{"unit_id":"waterfish111__dsh-glance#feature-1","repo":"waterfish111/dsh-glance","commit":"85500e8a4dae5565bd4b25dd645be9e9ddd8b11a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"一瞥 / Glance 的功能「框选屏幕并提问」：左键点击置顶悬浮球后冻结屏幕并拖出区域，组件裁切为 PNG，用户可附加问题；发送后插件将截图交给 DSH 模型会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["widget.ps1:1797-1837","widget.ps1:1712-1769","index.js:370-391"]}
{"unit_id":"waterfish111__dsh-glance#feature-2","repo":"waterfish111/dsh-glance","commit":"85500e8a4dae5565bd4b25dd645be9e9ddd8b11a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"一瞥 / Glance 的功能「同图连续追问」：首轮发送截图后，面板可继续输入问题；追问沿用当前分析会话，只提交文字，不重复发送截图。","source":"generated","evidence":["panel.html:972-982","index.js:394-403"]}
{"unit_id":"waterfish111__dsh-glance#feature-3","repo":"waterfish111/dsh-glance","commit":"85500e8a4dae5565bd4b25dd645be9e9ddd8b11a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"一瞥 / Glance 的功能「停止当前回答」：分析过程中可点停止；面板通知宿主取消当前会话生成，并将已收到的回答保留为已停止状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["panel.html:861-869","index.js:405-432"]}
{"unit_id":"waterfish111__dsh-glance#feature-4","repo":"waterfish111/dsh-glance","commit":"85500e8a4dae5565bd4b25dd645be9e9ddd8b11a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"一瞥 / Glance 的功能「独立线索会话」：每次新框选会创建新的分析会话；同一截图的追问复用该会话，并保存会话标识及轮数。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:130-150","index.js:288-367"]}
{"unit_id":"waterfish111__dsh-glance#caveat-1","repo":"waterfish111/dsh-glance","commit":"85500e8a4dae5565bd4b25dd645be9e9ddd8b11a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"一瞥会把你主动框选的屏幕区域编码为图片并提交到 DSH 当前选择的模型会话；是否传至外部服务取决于该模型的配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:387-391","widget.ps1:1256-1262"]}
